flowchart LR
  C[Customer browser]
  ID[Local Keycloak]
  OPID[Operator realm]
  CUSTID[Customer realm]
  UI[Storefront customer routes]
  ADMIN[Storefront admin routes]
  CAT[Catalog service]
  PRICE[Pricing service]
  INV[Inventory service]
  CS[Customer service]
  DB[(Customer database)]

  C --> UI
  UI -->|public search and product reads| CAT
  UI -->|active currency and prices| PRICE
  UI -->|availability snapshot| INV
  UI -->|customer PKCE login/registration| CUSTID
  UI -->|customer audience token| CS
  CS -->|derive owner from verified subject| DB
  ADMIN -->|operator PKCE login| OPID
  ADMIN -->|merchandising APIs| CAT
  ADMIN --> PRICE
  ADMIN --> INV
  UI -. no cross-service table access .-> DB

  ID --- OPID
  ID --- CUSTID

